1.11.0 2026-06-24
 - Montage set to easycap-M1 (the cap's electrode layout, per the lab) instead of the
   generic standard_1020. Used for the in-memory montage / channel sanity-check in
   conversion and for QC plotting (positions are still not shipped). README updated to
   recommend easycap-M1 for obtaining template coordinates.

1.10.0 2026-06-24
 - Corrected shot_target documentation: it ranges 0-4, not 0-3. 0 = no target hit;
   1-4 = the four target types (value 4 very rare -- 8 shots across 4 participants --
   consistent with the white "Bait" distractor). Updated events.json, the 20
   _physio.json sidecars, and the build_events/build_physio notebooks. Exact
   value-to-colour mapping still to be confirmed against the game source.

1.9.0 2026-06-24
 - Removed the per-subject scans.tsv files. With recording dates dropped, acq_time was
   n/a throughout, so they added nothing beyond the folder listing (scans.tsv is optional
   in BIDS). finalize_bids now deletes them.

1.8.0 2026-06-24
 - Removed the *_space-CapTrak_electrodes/coordsystem files (60 files). They held only
   the standard_1020 template, not digitised positions; the standard 10/20 layout is
   conveyed by the channel names + EEGPlacementScheme. Apply a standard montage to get
   template coordinates. (Electrode/coordsystem files are optional in BIDS-EEG.)

