   with target hit. Reconstructed from the behavioural Task-stream trigger channel;
   trial labels reproduce rawdata_trial_mat trialtype exactly for all 10 sessions.
 - Filled EEG sidecars from the protocol docs: reference FCz, ground Fpz, BrainAmp /
   actiCAP snap, hardware band-pass 0.016-1000 Hz, PowerLineFrequency 60 Hz.
 - README updated with task/condition definitions and data-quality notes.

1.0.0 2026-07-17
  - Initial OpenNeuro deposit of the Duorhythm BIDS dataset (EEG hyperscanning + continuous behaviour + phenotype; 20 subjects / 10 dyads).
  - BIDS 1.9.0 raw release; CC0-1.0; ethics HSR-2024-019-5.
  - Corresponds to local staging version 1.22.0 (see CHANGES).
